{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22347","headline":"游襄阳怀孟浩然 · 白居易","name":"游襄阳怀孟浩然","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"楚山碧岩岩，汉水碧汤汤。\n秀气结成象，孟氏之文章。\n今我讽遗文，思人至其乡。\n清风无人继，日暮空襄阳。\n南望鹿门山，蔼若有余芳。\n旧隐不知处，云深树苍苍。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22347.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22347","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}